# Open-addressing hash map lookup: r3 = map {+0 table}, r4 = key. The table is
# put at 0x4000C000: +16 entries (at 0x4000D000, 8 bytes {key, value}),
# +20 capacity 8. Keys 0..15 in the slots (0 = empty); slot 3 always empty so
# every probe ends (the real map is never full; a full one loops forever) and
# probes starting at slots 4-7 must wrap around to reach it. Search keys 0..15 (twice
# the capacity) so a probe can wrap and still find its key in slots 0-2
# (gate.py B2: with keys 0..7 a key found after the wrap was impossible, and a
# rewrite that wrapped to slot 1 instead of 0 passed).
r3 ptr
r4 len 15
mem32 @r3+0 fixed 0x4000C000
mem32 0x4000C010 fixed 0x4000D000
mem32 0x4000C014 fixed 8
mem32 0x4000D000 len 15
mem32 0x4000D008 len 15
mem32 0x4000D010 len 15
mem32 0x4000D018 fixed 0       # slot 3
mem32 0x4000D020 len 15
mem32 0x4000D028 len 15
mem32 0x4000D030 len 15
mem32 0x4000D038 len 15
